09","name":"Ladies motorbike leather jacket in retro style","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Thick yet soft cowhide leather\nCare instructions: You can care for the leather with leather balm\nInner lining is made of polyester\n3 outer pockets with zip\nProtectors are included in the scope of delivery\nThe jacket can be tightened at the sides\nSlim fit ladies cut\nPlease pay attention to the size chart\nAll zips are original YKK zips\nVery nice fit\nQuilted shoulders and arms\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\nAll protectors are removable","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1009-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1010","slug":"ladies-motorbike-leather-jacket-in-retro-style-black-white-pcp-lj-1010","name":"Ladies motorbike leather jacket in retro style black / white","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Soft lamb nappa leather\nCare instructions: You can care for the leather with leather balm\nInner lining is made of polyester\n3 outer pockets with zip\nProtectors are included\nThe jacket can be tightened at the sides\nSlim fit ladies cut\nPlease pay attention to the size chart\nAll zips are original YKK zips\nVery nice fit\nQuilted shoulders and arms\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\nAll protectors are removable","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1010-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1044","slug":"ladies-motorbike-cowhide-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1044","name":"Ladies motorbike cowhide leather jacket","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\r\nThick yet soft leather\r\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\r\nZip fastening\r\n4 outside pockets\r\n2 inside pockets\r\nAll fasteners are from the company YKK\r\nAdjustable zip on the cuffs\r\nVelcro fasteners at the waist\r\nQuilted shoulders\r\nand quilted sleeves\r\nSlim fit\r\nTailored ladies' cut\r\nPlease order at least one size larger\r\nThere are zips at the back to let the wind out and prevent the jacket from flapping.\r\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\r\nAll protectors are removable","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1044-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-145","slug":"women-s-motorcycle-chopper-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-145","name":"Women's Motorcycle Chopper Leather Jacket","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Genuine cowhide leather\r\nLeather thickness from 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\r\nFour front pockets with zippers\r\nTwo inside pockets\r\nSlim fit\r\nOff-center front zipper\r\nJacket can be fully zipped or unbuttoned with four buttons at the front to create a large V-neck\r\nReverse collar\r\nHalf-belt front with buckle closure\r\nTwo side pockets with zippers\r\nOne horizontal chest pocket with zipper\r\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper\r\nButtoned epaulettes\r\nZippered cuffs","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-145-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-144","slug":"women-s-retro-biker-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-144","name":"Women's Retro Biker Leather Jacket","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Genuine Lambskin Nappa Leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 mm\r\nSoft leather\r\nFour front pockets with zippers\r\nTwo inside pockets\r\nTailored fit, slim fit","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-144-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-149","slug":"women-s-motorcycle-chopper-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-149","name":"Women's Motorcycle Chopper Leather Jacket","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Genuine Lambskin Nappa Leather\r\nLeather thickness of 1.1 mm\r\nFour front pockets with zippers\r\nTwo inside pockets\r\nTailored slim fit\r\nOff-center front zipper\r\nJacket can be fully zipped or unbuttoned with four buttons at the front to create a large V-neck\r\nReverse collar\r\nHalf-belt front with buckle closure\r\nTwo side pockets with zippers\r\nOne horizontal chest pocket with zipper\r\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper\r\nButtoned epaulettes\r\nZippered cuffs","material":"Genuine lamb nappa leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-149-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-143","slug":"women-s-fringe-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-143","name":"Women's Fringe Leather Jacket","category":"Women's Jacket","categorySlug":"women-s-jacket","description":"Fringe Leather Jacket\r\nEye-catching women's leather jacket\r\nJacket made of genuine, robust cowhide\r\nVery good quality and workmanship\r\nComfortable to wear\r\nBase color: Black\r\nMaterial: 100% COWHIDE\r\nL